{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17356","headline":"九日北楼宴集 · 权德舆","name":"九日北楼宴集","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"萧飒秋声楼上闻，霜风漠漠起阴云。\n不见携觞王太守，空思落帽孟参军。\n风吟蟋蟀寒偏急，酒泛茱萸晚易醺。\n心忆旧山何日见，并将愁泪共纷纷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17356.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17356","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}